  <title id="c14-title">Network Ports</title>
  <body>
    <section id="c14-sec-endpoints">
      <title id="c14-sec-endpoints-title">Listening ports</title>
      <p id="c14-p-admin">The admin console listens on port 8443.</p>
      <p id="c14-p-api">The REST API listens on port 8443.</p>
      <p id="c14-p-health">The health probe is served on port 8443.</p>
      <p id="c14-p-metrics">Metrics are exposed on port 8443.</p>
      <p id="c14-p-firewall">Open port 8443 for inbound TLS traffic.</p>
    </section>
